          <body>**CDIF**

Definition
==========

XAS-specific provenance activity building block. Extends cdifProvActivity with XAS analysis event typing (xas:analysisevent), XAS facility location, sample object, XAS-specific instrument type, and XAS additional properties (edge_energy, calibration method, instrument configuration, installedOptions).
:title: "XAS Analysis Event activity"
:prefix: ``schema``
:typeSchema: {"type": "array", "items": {"type": "string"}}
:typeOptional:
:noId:
:extends:
:untypedRoot:</body>
